12:["$","$1","c",{"children":[[["$","div",null,{"className":"sm-mb-50 commonBanner2-module__m8QleG__commonbanner2","style":{"--bg":"url(/_next/static/media/banner.449ccac4.webp) no-repeat center center / cover"},"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"frame-1200 py-100 sm-pt-0 sm-pb-10 sm-px-20 commonBanner2-module__m8QleG__content","children":[["$","h2",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"Website Migration Services in Dubai for </br>Smooth, Secure Transitions"}}],["$","p",null,{"className":"my-30","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"Experience hassle-free website migration in Dubai with Website Development Agency. We ensure your website </br>moves seamlessly to a new platform or server, keeping your data safe, & performance intact."}}],["$","$L8",null,{"href":"/contact-us","className":"blue-btn","children":"Get a Free Consultation"}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"frame-1200 py-100 sm-pt-0 sm-pb-50 sm-px-20","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Website Migration for Uninterrupted Online Success"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"commonIntroduction-module__IKzCgq__flex","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"commonIntroduction-module__IKzCgq__box","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"commonIntroduction-module__IKzCgq__gapcontent","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":" <p>Website migration is an essential move for online businesses that want to raise their digital profile, improve performance, or adopt modern platforms. If you’re transferring to a new CMS, changing your domain, or moving to a different hosting environment, a migration that is done right will keep your business operations running without any downtime and your SEO efforts safe.</p>\n                    <p>At Website Development Agency, we realize that a migration is not only about relocating files, but it is also about keeping the brand and the digital identity the same. Our professionals don’t leave anything to chance and they plan down to the smallest detail the entire process, they check the structure, data, and the content of your site to make sure that everything is going to be transferred perfectly.</p>\n                    "}}],["$","$L7",null,{"src":{"src":"/_next/static/media/intro.fa7b898e.webp","width":1256,"height":664,"blurWidth":8,"blurHeight":4,"blurDataURL":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"alt":"introimg-1"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"commonIntroduction-module__IKzCgq__box","children":[["$","$L7",null,{"src":{"src":"/_next/static/media/intro-2.1c1312f5.webp","width":1256,"height":664,"blurWidth":8,"blurHeight":4,"blurDataURL":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"alt":"introimg-1"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"commonIntroduction-module__IKzCgq__gapcontent","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"  <p>We do not forget to keep SEO at the center point by doing proper redirects, changing metadata, and protecting rankings. Our strategy is that organic traffic does not reduce, and users get the same experience.</p>\n                <p>If you were scaling your business, changing the website structure, or modernizing your digital ecosystem, the flawless migration we perform would be the guarantee that your growth is not stopped. With Website Development Agency, it is not just a move that you do with your website, it is a lift to make it perform better, be more reliable, and have success that lasts.</p>\n                    "}}]]}]]}]]}],"$L16","$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e"],["$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22","$L23"],"$L24"]}]
